For all integers $a\geq 2$ and $b\geq a(a-1)$, and all finite-dimensional complex V, is the canonical multiplication-and-averaging map $Sym^{b}(Sym^{a}V)\to Sym^{a}(Sym^{b}V)$ surjective?

