\item OpenAI, \emph{Quadratic stabilization of the canonical Foulkes–Howe map}, 2026-09-25; citation key \texttt{OAI:Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Quadratic-Stabilization-of-the-Canonical-Foulkes-Howe-Map-September-25-2026/build/paper.tex\#L99}{thm:main}.
\item Family 210: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/210.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/FoulkesHowe.json}{Comparator FoulkesHowe.json}.
